    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Reconstruct paleogeography over the age range of extant species and test for continuous or nearly continuous emergent land corridors connecting modern continents to oceanic islands. Any securely dated continuous corridor would refute the relevant regional claim.";
